{"id":"n61609-1-10","stage":4,"title":"살금살금 · 悄悄地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61609-1-10-1","ko":"넌 도대체 어디를 가길래 매일 살금살금 집을 나가니?","zh":"你到底要去哪儿，才会每天都偷偷摸摸地离开家啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도대체","meaning":"到底，究竟","explanation":"도대체：到底，究竟","readings":[{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14385","senseId":"3","lemma":"도대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가길래","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；길래：说明说话人据以采取行动的原因或发现。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살금살금","meaning":"悄悄地，蹑手蹑脚地，鬼鬼祟祟地","explanation":"살금살금：悄悄地，蹑手蹑脚地，鬼鬼祟祟地","readings":[{"term":"살금살금","audio":"/audio/ba406a227037d69d7e5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61609","senseId":"1","lemma":"살금살금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집을","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가니?","meaning":"离开","explanation":"나가다：离开；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"10","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"5961e5da228541d4","term":"도대체","zh":"到底，究竟","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3","entryId":"14385","definition":"非常好奇而问的话。","pronunciation":["도대체"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"ba406a227037d69d","term":"살금살금","zh":"悄悄地，蹑手蹑脚地，鬼鬼祟祟地","audio":"/audio/ba406a227037d69d7e5d.mp3","entryId":"61609","definition":"为使他人不知而察言观色，并安静小心地不断移动的样子。","pronunciation":["살금살금"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"离开","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"从某个地区或空间，或曾所属的地方出去。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8b0d55e5724dc260a53.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61609-1-10-2","ko":"친구들이랑 놀러 다니느라 그랬어요. 죄송해요.","zh":"因为要和朋友一起出去玩。对不起。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구들이랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니느라","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；느라：说明因忙于前一动作而出现后续情况，常接不利结果。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬어요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6ef75f0ff00b29813b96.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61609","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你到底要去哪儿，才会每天都偷偷摸摸地离开家啊？","因为要和朋友一起出去玩。对不起。","听说今天有聚会，怎么已经回家了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你到底要去哪儿，才会每天都偷偷摸摸地离开家啊？","因为要和朋友一起出去玩。对不起。","听说今天有聚会，怎么已经回家了？"],"answer":1}]}
